  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "Communal round dance of the Buryats of the Baikal region, in which dancers link arms or shoulders and move sunwise in a ring, often at night around a fire, while singing; a leader starts each verse and the circle takes it up, and the tempo quickens as the dance goes on. It is danced at summer festivals and gatherings in Aga, Khori and other Buryat districts and is staged by the Baikal State Ensemble.",
